OL,3,GNEWSAWales has a school standards
OL,4,Acrisis. Will plans to fix it actually
OL,5,Awork?
OL,6,
OL,7,FWales has a school standards crisis.
OL,8,FWill plans to fix it actually work?
OL,10,FAs you dip into the valley on the way
OL,11,Finto Merthyr Tydfil, a new earthy-toned
OL,12,Fbuilding dominates the view.
OL,14,FIt's the new site of Saint Carlo Acutis
OL,15,FCatholic School. With its rooftop
OL,16,Fscience garden, solar panels and
OL,17,Ffloor-to-ceiling windows, it's an
OL,18,Fimpressive sight.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
