OL,3,GNEWSAWales has a school standards
OL,4,Acrisis. Will plans to fix it actually
OL,5,Awork?
OL,6,
OL,7,FExcited staff and 940 pupils moved into
OL,8,Fthe #50m complex at the start of
OL,9,FSeptember. But they did so just as the
OL,10,FWelsh education system was being
OL,11,Fpainted in a less positive light, with
OL,12,FWales once again ranking the worst of
OL,13,FUK nations in global tests.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
